        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 5:48PM CDT by NWS Amarillo TX</headline>
        <description>At 548 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 6
miles north of Friona, moving northeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Bootleg.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
